IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `faa-administration`

-- A New Tax System (Family Assistance) (Administration) Act 1999, claims, instalments on an estimate, reconciliation, debts and review -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_a-new-tax-system-family-assistance-administration-act-1999_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Dollar figures for FTB are taken from the Family Assistance Act baseline at the rates AS PRINTED in its Compilation
-- No. 124; they are not the amounts paid in 2036. Incomes, estimates and days are ASSUMED where the scenario gives none.
-- Income years are named by the year they end (2036 = 2035-36).

§ `Fixtures`

`Chloe's claim 60 days before Oliver is due` MEANS `My instalment claim` WITH
